**Title:** Whispering Waves and Quiet Bravery

**Description:** Drift into a serene world where the rhythmic lull of the ocean whispers secrets of peace and calm. Join Leo, an eleven-year-old boy of quiet bravery, as he embarks on a tranquil journey along a coastal shoreline with his playful otter companion, Finn. As the sun sets, painting the sky in hues of lavender and rose, the pair explore sandy beaches and rocky outcrops, discovering treasures of the sea under a canopy of starlit sky. This sleep story invites you to breathe in the fresh, salty air and feel the gentle tug of a calming breeze, all while fostering emotional calm and reducing anxiety. Let the soothing narrative guide you into a deep, restful sleep, as Leo finds his place in the vast beauty of the world around him.

